      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 55 Solution: AI Workflow Troubleshooting\n\nAn AI agent with two fail-fast validation gates: one before the AI call (missing required field) and one after (empty/malformed AI response), each returning a distinct error instead of corrupting downstream data silently.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** OpenAI API key. None needed to test the validation branches.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_55_AI_Workflow_Troubleshooting.md for the full task.",
