    {
      "id": "troubleshooting-table-sticky",
      "name": "Troubleshooting Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1560, 20],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Troubleshooting Guide\n\n| Symptom | Likely Cause | Where to Look | Fix |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Immediate 400, no AI call made | Required field missing from webhook body | Validate Required Fields node's input data | Restore the missing field (e.g. `user_message`) in the caller's payload |\n| Execution fails on the AI node itself | Invalid/expired API key (401/403 in node error) | AI Troubleshoot Call node's error output | Regenerate the key in your provider's dashboard, update the n8n credential, reactivate the workflow |\n| Response cuts off mid-sentence/mid-JSON | max_tokens set too low | AI Troubleshoot Call node's options.maxTokens | Raise maxTokens (e.g. 400+) and re-run |\n| Execution fails with HTTP 429 | AI provider rate limit exceeded | The failing node's error message (`rate_limit_exceeded`) | Add/lengthen a Wait/throttle step (Day 53 pattern) between calls |\n| Execution hangs then times out | Wrong URL or unreachable host on an HTTP Request node | The HTTP Request node's error output and configured URL | Correct the URL, confirm the target service is reachable, add a reasonable timeout |\n| `content.length > 0` check fails downstream | Malformed/empty AI response reached Validate AI Response | Validate AI Response node's input JSON | Confirmed caught here — routes to Malformed Response Error instead of corrupting downstream data |",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 560
      }
    }
  ],
